WEBVTT

00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:08.051
[ metallic scraping]

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.099
HERMIONE:
I can't believe

00:00:12.143 --> 00:00:13.492
they're going
to kill Buckbeak.

00:00:13.535 --> 00:00:14.667
It's just too horrible.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:15.885
It just got worse.

00:00:15.929 --> 00:00:17.365
DRACO:
Did I tell you?

00:00:17.409 --> 00:00:20.194
Father said I can keep
the hippogriff's head.

00:00:20.238 --> 00:00:21.413
I think I'll donate it

00:00:21.456 --> 00:00:22.979
to the Gryffindors'
common room.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.024
GOYLE:Wicked!

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:25.330
Huh, look
who's here.

00:00:25.373 --> 00:00:28.202
DRACO:
Ah, come to see the show?

00:00:28.246 --> 00:00:29.160
You!

00:00:29.203 --> 00:00:30.596
You foul, loathsome, evil

00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:31.640
little cockroach!

00:00:31.684 --> 00:00:33.425
RON:
Hermione, no!

00:00:33.468 --> 00:00:36.515
He's not worth it.

00:00:36.558 --> 00:00:39.300
[ whimpering]

00:00:47.569 --> 00:00:49.267
[ chuckles, grunts]

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:52.531
Malfoy,
you okay?

00:00:52.574 --> 00:00:53.619
Let's go.

00:00:53.662 --> 00:00:55.838
Quick. Run.Wait for me.

00:00:55.882 --> 00:00:58.406
That felt good.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:01.975
Not good-- brilliant.

00:01:06.109 --> 00:01:10.244
[ thunder rumbling]

00:01:19.775 --> 00:01:21.560
HAGRID:
Oh, look at him.

00:01:21.603 --> 00:01:24.476
Loves the smell of
the trees when the wind

00:01:24.519 --> 00:01:25.738
blows through them.

00:01:25.781 --> 00:01:26.695
Why don't we just
set him free?

00:01:26.739 --> 00:01:28.131
Ah, they'd know it was me,

00:01:28.175 --> 00:01:30.395
and then Dumbledore
would get into trouble.

00:01:30.438 --> 00:01:32.788
He's coming down,
you know, Dumbledore.

00:01:32.832 --> 00:01:35.835
Says he wants to be
with me when they...

00:01:35.878 --> 00:01:38.011
when it happens.

00:01:38.054 --> 00:01:40.579
Great man, Dumbledore.

00:01:40.622 --> 00:01:42.276
Great man.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:44.409
[ cawing]

00:01:44.452 --> 00:01:45.758
HERMIONE:
We'll stay

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.455
with you, too, Hagrid.

00:01:47.499 --> 00:01:48.891
You'll do no such thing.

00:01:48.935 --> 00:01:50.458
Think I want you seeing
something like that?

00:01:50.502 --> 00:01:53.287
No, you just drink
your tea and be off.

00:01:53.331 --> 00:01:56.247
Oh, before you do, Ron...

00:02:03.079 --> 00:02:04.167
Scabbers!

00:02:04.211 --> 00:02:05.647
You're alive.

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:07.214
Want to keep a closer eye
on your pets, Ron.

00:02:07.258 --> 00:02:09.477
I think that means you
owe someone an apology.

00:02:09.521 --> 00:02:11.044
Right.

00:02:11.087 --> 00:02:13.307
Next time I see Crookshanks,
I'll let him know.

00:02:13.351 --> 00:02:14.482
I meant me!

00:02:14.526 --> 00:02:16.005
HAGRID:
Blimey!

00:02:16.049 --> 00:02:17.877
What was that?

00:02:21.446 --> 00:02:22.577
Ow!

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.798
Hagrid.

00:02:27.452 --> 00:02:28.540
Oh, crikey.

00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:30.411
[ cawing]

00:02:30.455 --> 00:02:32.631
[ indistinct talking]

00:02:32.674 --> 00:02:35.242
It's late. It's nearly dark.

00:02:35.286 --> 00:02:37.026
You shouldn't be here.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:38.985
If someone sees you outside
the castle this time of night,

00:02:39.028 --> 00:02:40.987
you'll be in trouble--
big trouble.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:42.554
Particularly
you, Harry.

00:02:42.597 --> 00:02:44.817
[ knocking]With you in a moment!

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:45.905
[ cawing]

00:02:45.948 --> 00:02:46.862
[ whispering]:
Quick.

00:02:46.906 --> 00:02:48.864
Quick.

00:02:48.908 --> 00:02:49.865
Hagrid.

00:02:49.909 --> 00:02:51.650
It'll be fine.

00:02:51.693 --> 00:02:52.651
It'll be okay.

00:02:52.694 --> 00:02:53.608
Go on. Go on.

00:02:53.652 --> 00:02:55.262
[ knocking]

00:02:58.221 --> 00:03:01.355
[ indistinct talking]

00:03:01.399 --> 00:03:02.748
Mr. Dumbledore.Good evening.

00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:05.620
Minister, just make
your way through.

